    "body": "Advances the P1 authorization/privacy audit for private chat data.\n\n- Require a persisted authenticated actor before user chat send, history, conversation-list and read-state operations reach any repository or dependent service.\n- Close the direct conversation-list repository path and the message idempotency lookup that previously ran before identity was established.\n- Add regression coverage for missing and transient principals proving zero interactions with chat/job/read-state/user persistence, access checks, block checks, notifications and realtime delivery.\n- Document the private-chat fail-closed invariant in `docs/SECURITY.md`.\n\nMerge gate: validate this exact PR head; all relevant CI/security checks and review threads must be green/resolved; re-check master freshness immediately before merge; merge commit only.",
